@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Backhand front-court drives
Backhand front-court drives, two minutes. A step in front of the short line, a racket length off the
side wall. Straight drives to length, a racket head above the service line with the first bounce
behind the service box, turning your shoulders more than feels natural.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Go around the ball, not at it.
1:10 Racket away from your body. Use the space.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
